# Browse and open: enter folders, go back and forward, open a text file in its program, switch to the column view.
Output assets/readme/feature-browse.gif
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Source assets/readme/tapes/lib/common.tape
Type "lazyfinder" Enter
Wait+Screen@20s /Favorites/
Show
Sleep 1s

Down
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 900ms
Down
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s

Backspace
Sleep 900ms
Type "["
Sleep 900ms
Type "]"
Sleep 900ms

Type "M"
Sleep 1.5s
Up
Sleep 1s
Up
Sleep 1.5s
Type "M"
Sleep 1s

Type "q"
